   * @param productId Unique identifier of the parent product that owns this variant.
   * @param variantId Unique identifier of the variant to update.
   * @param body Fields to update on the variant including SKU code, option values, and optional price override. Stock quantity is not editable through this endpoint.
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor seller
